The mean and variance of 5 observations are 3 and 2 respectively. If three of the five observations are 1, 3 and 5, find the values of other two observations.

#### Solution

bar"x" = 3,Var (X) = 2, n = 5, x1 = 1, x2 = 3, x3 = 5 .......[Given]

