∴ (∑"x"_"i"^2)/5 = 2 + 9

∴ ∑"x"_"i"^2= 5 × 11

∴ ∑"x"_"i"^2 = 55

Now,

∑xi = 1 + 3 + 5 x4 + x5

∴ 15 = 9 + x4 + x5

∴ x4 + x5 = 15 − 9

∴ x4 + x5 = 6
∴ x5 = 6 − x4 ...........(i)

∑xi2 = 12 + 32 + 52 + x42 + x52

∴ 55 = 1 + 9 + 25 + x42 + (6 − x4)2 .....[From (i)]

∴ 55 = 35 + x42 + 36 − 12x4 + "x"_4^2

∴ 2x42 − 12x4 + 16 = 0

∴ x42 − 6x4 + 8 = 0

∴ x42 − 4x4 − 2x4 + 8 = 0

∴ x4(x4 − 4) −2(x4 − 4) = 0

∴ (x4 − 4)(x4 − 2) = 0

∴ x4 = 4 or x4 = 2

